# S18, member b (k10, slot 1): with a to the west end of stag0101; steps on the mat while a stands on it (after a's
# No), answers its own prompt No and steps off; then steps on while a's second prompt runs and answers No when asked
# (its own answer, not the prompt's timeout).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-308,-190}
wander -285 -190 6 until sealed>=8800
idle until onmat:matz02>=1,prompt=0,frames>=120
log b steps on after a's no
mat matz02 no until answered>=1,prompt=0,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log b said no
goto -325 -190 5 fail stagechange
log b off the mat
idle until onmat:matz02<=0,frames>=60 fail stagechange
idle until prompt=1,frames>=30 fail stagechange
log a's prompt runs: b steps on
# (b presses until the prompt no longer asks it: its own No, well before the prompt's 600-frame timeout says No for it.)
mat matz02 no until answered>=1,asking<=0 fail stagechange,frames>=400
log b said no to a's exit
idle until present=1,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log b stays
idle until frames>=300
